SlowQuitGuard is a Swift reimplementation developed with reference to the
source code and interaction design of SlowQuitApps. Its hold-to-quit behavior
and implementation were informed by that project. We thank Douglas Teoh and
all upstream contributors for making their work available as free software.

The Swift reimplementation is dated 2026-10-30. Attribution is also included
in the README and relevant core source files. The application icon is generated
by script/generate_icon.swift; upstream icon assets are not included.
